# Used by `npm run dev:device` (vite --mode device) for testing on a real phone.
#
# The dev server runs over HTTPS in this mode, so the API must be HTTPS too --
# a secure page calling a plain-HTTP API is blocked as mixed content. Pointing
# at the deployed API is the simplest option and needs no extra setup.
#
# To hit a local API instead, run it over HTTPS (`dotnet dev-certs https --trust`),
# set the URL below to https://<your-lan-ip>:7155, and add that origin to
# Cors:AllowedOrigins in Grocery.Api/appsettings.Development.json.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://grocery-api.agreeablesea-ea438f57.uaenorth.azurecontainerapps.io
